      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A new magnetometer for the recording of the heart's magnetic field is described in brief. Two constituents of the magnetocardiographic vector were examined in 13 normal male subjects and one coronary patient. In spite of identical sources of potentials and the same type of waves, magneto- and electrocardiograms were shown to differ significantly in terms of wave correlations."},
